Maintainer: Shahin Mohammadi <shahin.mohammadi@gmail.com>
Description: ACTIONetExperiment (ACE) extends the SummarizedExperiment class
    to match the structure of Python AnnData objects, adding first-class
    containers for row and column reductions, embeddings, networks, and their
    metadata. It was developed to accompany the ACTIONet single-cell framework
    but works standalone, and ACE objects are usable wherever
    SummarizedExperiment or SingleCellExperiment objects are expected.
